  "divergence_kill_condition": {
    "pre_registered": "if D does not lead LEVEL by a POSITIVE MEDIAN in units of s on real tape, the construction closes as a detector and only s_min survives.",
    "min_onsets_to_read": 30,
    "how_the_condition_is_read": "A POINT ESTIMATE IS NOT A LEAD. The condition is read against a two-sided binomial test of the share of matched onsets on which D fired first, versus the 50% the circular-shift null gives by construction. A positive median that a binomial cannot separate from chance does not clear it.",
