    "median_D_at_s_star": -1.2894031940158668,
    "met": true,
    "verdict": "KILL CONDITION MET. The point estimate is +0.229 s-units but the share of onsets on which D fires first is not distinguishable from chance (binomial p=0.349 on n=41, from 20 of 75 events). A point estimate is not a lead. And it comes from the RELATIVE form, which is not parameter-free -- the property D was proposed for. The construction closes as a detector; only s_min survives."
